# Cursor AI Rules

# Canonical Constitution Reference
# All rules are defined in and synchronized from AGENTS.md.
# Read AGENTS.md before making structural changes.

- Stack: HTML5/Canvas/Tailwind (Web) + SwiftUI/SPM (Native).
- Crucial: Always mirror changes from `index.html` to `preview.html`.
- Mobile UX: Safe-area insets, multi-touch isolation, zero default scrolling during gameplay.
- Do not introduce heavy bundlers (Vite/Webpack) or external backends unless explicitly requested.
- Update `PROJECT_STATUS.md` and `HANDOFF.md` on task completion.
